                <note rend="inline" type="source">Marshall Mission Files, Lot 54–D270:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Committee of Three to
                        the Three Commissioners at Peiping</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chungking</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-01-25">25 January 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>103. The Committee of Three, consisting of Governor Chang Chun, General Chou
                    En-lai and General Marshall, desire that an immediate detailed report of the
                    situation in and around Chihfeng in the province of Jehol be submitted, together
                    with your recommendations. Please expedite action.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
